{"symbol":"EXATO","yahoo":"EXATO.BO","bse":null,"isin":null,"name":"Exato Technologies Limited","sector":"Technology","industry":"Information Technology Services","website":"https://www.exato.ai","about":"Exato Technologies Limited provides Customer Experience-as-a-Service (CXaaS) and AI-as-a-Service platforms in India and internationally. The Company's integrated service portfolio comprises customer experience and analytics, unified communications, AI Infrastructure, the proprietary ExatoIQ platform and Cloud ERP solutions; The CX and analytics offering, such as CXaaS, conversational AI, chatbots, voice bots, natural language processing, generative AI, automation-as-a-service, robotic process automation, and workforce management. Its unified communications offering include secure communication and IT foundations, including UCaaS platforms, voice, messaging, video and collaboration tools, networking and IT infrastructure, and CRM/ERP integrations; and AI infrastructure offering covers enterprise-grade compute, networking, storage, AI platforms, and enterprise systems. The Company also provides cloud ERP implementation and support services. It serves banking, financial services and insurance, healthcare, retail, telecom, manufacturing, and IT/ITeS & BPO/KPO industries. The company was incorporated in 2016 and is based in Noida, India.","updated":"2026-09-26T06:21:56+00:00","quote":{"price":677.1,"prevClose":671.05,"marketCap":681.5,"high52":785.95,"low52":266.0,"pe":35.9,"bookValue":87.7,"dividendRate":0.0,"roe":null,"shares":1.0065,"insiders":79.02,"institutions":1.64},"prices":{"dates":["2025-12-05","2025-12-08","2025-12-09","2025-12-10","2025-12-11","2025-12-12","2025-12-15","2025-12-16","2025-12-17","2025-12-18","2025-12-19","2025-12-22","2025-12-23","2025-12-24","2025-12-26","2025-12-29","2025-12-30","2025-12-31","2026-01-01","2026-01-02","2026-01-05","2026-01-06","2026-01-07","2026-01-08","2026-01-09","2026-01-12","2026-01-13","2026-01-14","2026-01-16","2026-01